    "body": "## Summary\n- expose authenticated saved-job API helpers in the web client\n- let signed-in users save open discovery cards through the idempotent backend endpoint\n- add protected `/saved-jobs` navigation and a paginated shortlist page\n- allow users to remove bookmarks and automatically recover from an emptied trailing page\n- reuse privacy-safe `JobResponse` cards and document the web flow\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- the shortlist route remains behind the existing authentication guard\n- the UI only consumes the existing privacy-safe job response; exact participant-only locations remain untouched\n- save/remove operations rely on authenticated, idempotent backend endpoints introduced in #39\n\n## Validation\nCI should run frontend lint/build, Maven tests, Flyway/PostgreSQL smokes and the existing runtime gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
